    "description": "Watchtower, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Log watchtower: spiral stair inside four posts up to a railed lookout (floor at y 4), hip roof; L2 walls the base with arrow slits, awning and bell; L3 adds a pointed cap with a flag. 4 x 4 core, not 3 x 3 (a walkable stair needs it). Not yet builder-tested: bell, blue_wall_banner, lightning_rod, moss_carpet, red_banner, red_wall_banner, vine, white_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item_frame.",
    "changes": "More detail on L2 and L3: L2 boards the base into a guardhouse with arrow slits and shutters, an awning with an alarm bell over the door, banners, a brazier and supply crates; L3 adds a pointed roof cap with a flag, corner lanterns, ivy, shields by the door and a weapon rack (the roof sits one lower so the cap fits in 9).",
